            <button id="cloud-vault-pick" type="button" class="gb-btn gb-btn-quiet" style="padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:6px;background:#252525;color:#d4d4d4;cursor:pointer;">Dropboxから選ぶ</button>
